Subject: [PATCH v2] crypto: hisilicon/sec - remove SEC crypto block cipher accelerator
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 15:53:53 +0800
Message-ID: <20260819075353.94500-1-huangchenghai2@huawei.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.0
